  { name: 'Sam Milne',        time: 'New',          href: '/portfolio/milne-industrial/',            project: 'Milne Industrial',            context: 'Industrial · Website development', text: 'Had a great experience working with NC Digital on the development of the Milne Industrial website. They took the time to understand our business, our requirements and the direction we wanted to take the website in. Very pleased with the finished result and would happily recommend their services to other businesses looking for a reliable and professional team.' },
